{
  "$comment": [
    "The command catalogue, read by BOTH sides of the app.",
    "TypeScript imports it in src/lib/commands/registry.ts; Rust embeds it at",
    "compile time in src-tauri/src/menu.rs to build the native macOS menu.",
    "One file so the menu and the palette cannot drift apart.",
    "",
    "id           stable identity; also the native menu item id",
    "label        shown verbatim in the palette AND the menu, so the axbridge",
    "             path 'Category > Label' is derivable from this file alone",
    "category     groups the palette and becomes a native submenu",
    "shortcut     display string for the palette only: NOT a real accelerator.",
    "             Registering these as menu accelerators would consume the key",
    "             before the webview sees it (see the CmdOrCtrl+W note in lib.rs).",
    "requiresProject  the action provably does nothing without an open project,",
    "             so the menu greys it out instead of letting it no-op."
  ],
  "commands": [
